# Network Monitor v2 Requirements

To run Network Monitor v2, install the following Python packages:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## requirements.txt

```txt
Flask
requests
scapy
netifaces
```

## Python Version

Python 3.10+

## Run

```bash
python3 run_soc.py
```

Note:

Network scanning requires administrator/root privileges because Scapy performs ARP scanning on the network.
